Comment: The Wayland layer-shell support (the layer=, edge=, dist= and
 reserve= tag attributes) is derived from the BunsenLabs gtk3dialog fork,
 https://github.com/BunsenLabs/gtk3dialog, which is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later.
 Dima Krasner introduced layer-shell support there (commit 025cc69,
 2021-11-09); Mick Amadio extended it with edge anchoring (cf4e621), the
 exclusive zone (def62a6) and opposite-edge anchoring (21056f0).

